WEBVTT

00:00:00.203 --> 00:00:03.435
Someone returning something? Do it from <b>Tickets</b>

00:00:03.515 --> 00:00:06.380
Find the sale and tap <b>Editar</b> (edit)

00:00:06.554 --> 00:00:11.385
You can swap a product, fix the quantity or return it

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:14.504
Tap <b>Devolver</b> (return) on the product they bring back

00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:19.968
Write down the reason: it records who did it and why

00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:27.696
MiCaja tells you how much to give the customer. The stock goes back on its own and the cash count deducts the refund
